From 1ff2a207051f4d2f93f854ae7891d4137b44f446 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 02:06:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fixed: Run unit tests on JDK 11

Robolectric 4.4 fails to load classes on the newer default JDK of the
runner, so every test using it failed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GLNsTPnn2xKUQ4uFcevT6G
---
 .github/workflows/run_tests.yml | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/run_tests.yml b/.github/workflows/run_tests.yml
index f8d33fd4..2534cd83 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/run_tests.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/run_tests.yml
@@ -16,6 +16,12 @@ jobs:
     steps:
     - name: Clone repository
       uses: actions/checkout@v4
+    - name: Set up JDK 11
+      # Robolectric 4.4 can't read the class files of newer JDKs.
+      uses: actions/setup-java@v4
+      with:
+        distribution: temurin
+        java-version: 11
     - name: Execute tests
       run: |
         ./gradlew test
-- 
